# The outputs on システム環境設定's 画面サイズ page (docs/tessronos 10.4.10), for tools/ui_run.py with
# UI_SCREENS=2 (QEMU's second bochs-display, right of the first at start). The window is at 160,80:
# the device list's first line at 206,181 and 表示 at 706,184; on the screen's page the parts
# 166 right and 108 down of where the panel puts them: the outputs' pop-up at 290,157 (a list
# opens with the row chosen over the part, a row 20 high), 使う at 452,157, 使わない at 536,157,
# the side's pop-up at 670,157, 識別 at 508,554, 設定 at 706,554. The desktop's question is answered with Enter
# to keep what was set.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen page 1280x800
expect output 1 of 2
wait 500
shot so_main
# the second output chosen: its size, on, right of the main one
click 290 157
wait 300
click 290 177
expect output 2 of 2
wait 500
shot so_second
# off
click 536 157
wait 200
click 706 554
wait 1500
key 28
expect sysenv: screen OUT1 off
expectin 30 output 1 kept as DISPLAY.
wait 800
shot so_off
# on again, below the main one
click 452 157
wait 200
click 670 157
wait 300
click 670 177
wait 300
click 706 554
wait 1500
key 28
expect sysenv: screen OUT1 on
expectin 30 below 0
wait 800
shot so_below
# and right of it again
click 670 157
wait 300
click 670 137
wait 300
click 706 554
wait 1500
key 28
expectin 30 right 0
wait 800
shot so_right
# 識別: each screen's number on it for three seconds
click 508 554
expect numbers shown, 2
wait 800
shot so_ident
wait 3000
